Error [E0372]: this `if` body needs braces
  --> tests/ui/control_body_needs_braces.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     if true print("if") else print("else")
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: braces make the body's boundary visible to readers, editors, and the compiler
 Fix: wrap the body in `{ ... }`; `jet fmt` applies this fix

